extensions/damage-control.ts
damage-control-rules.json

Ported from disler/pi-vs-claude-code, at
https://github.com/disler/pi-vs-claude-code -- the hook from
extensions/damage-control.ts, the rule set from .pi/damage-control-rules.yaml.

Modified by Okky Mabruri. Deviations in the hook are marked `PORT:` in the
source, each with a reason. The rule set keeps upstream's four-key schema
(zeroAccessPaths, readOnlyPaths, noDeletePaths, bashToolPatterns) and 13 of its
bash patterns verbatim; it is serialised as JSON rather than YAML and the
remaining entries are this project's own.

